        explanation: { en: "Referees and officials can contribute to more sustainable athletics events through practical choices, including: using electronic start lists and results; reducing unnecessary printing; reusing folders, signs and officiating materials; sorting waste; using refillable bottles; sharing transport or using public transport; switching off unused electronic equipment; protecting the competition venue and surrounding environment. These measures should never compromise safety, accuracy or accessibility. Instead, sustainability should be incorporated into event organisation wherever practical. The project identifies sustainable event management, waste reduction, recycling and lower-impact transport as important parts of its Sustainability pillar.", bg: "" },
        keyMessage: { en: "Officials help shape the standards of an event through both their decisions and their everyday working practices.", bg: "" },
